@@s001 The 12 questions
@@s002 <span>Exam</span>
@@s003 The 12 questions
@@s004 Each question is linked to the exercises of one week (the folder <code>WN</code>) and has several <b>focus points</b>; at the exam one of them may come up at random. Here is the list from the exam document (July 2026 version, provisional until mid-December), briefly translated, with where to study it in the atlas.
@@s005 Week of the question ≠ week of the lecture
@@s006 "Exercise Week N" refers to the exercises in the folder <code>WN</code>, which mainly concern the lecture of the week before. The pages of the atlas are sorted by folder.
